<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/3sooje6w2zc3a.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/13a-m4yf6a6w8.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3_yrb3xfc2s-u.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1l8t_tf67v76z.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1lxx8o3sq52ke.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0c3-9fyjb-1b1.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/12_6afifx99-z.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1g_nxoa96zpiv.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/1lfvyplzhoiau.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2vs5hymo138hj.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2aedevc9nlb0r.js" async=""></script><title>AI Product Image Checks for Visible Accuracy | Pairvu</title><meta name="description" content="Use evidence-backed checks for product quantity, label text, packaging, logos, color, components, and visibility before publishing an AI-assisted product image."/><meta name="application-name" content="Pairvu"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://pairvu.com/checks"/><meta property="og:title" content="AI Product Image Checks for Visible Accuracy | Pairvu"/><meta property="og:description" content="Use evidence-backed checks for product quantity, label text, packaging, logos, color, components, and visibility before publishing an AI-assisted product image."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://pairvu.com/checks"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Pairvu"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://pairvu.com/opengraph-image"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Pairvu AI product image checker"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="AI Product Image Checks for Visible Accuracy | Pairvu"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Use evidence-backed checks for product quantity, label text, packaging, logos, color, components, and visibility before publishing an AI-assisted product image."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pairvu.com/opengraph-image"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.1si4amm9w0f74.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","@id":"https://pairvu.com/#organization","name":"Pairvu","url":"https://pairvu.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://pairvu.com/brand/pairvu-app-icon.png","width":512,"height":512},"description":"Pairvu is an AI product image checker that compares an AI-generated or edited product image against an original reference image."}</script><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><div class="site-header-inner"><a class="site-logo" aria-label="Pairvu home" href="/">Pairvu</a><button aria-controls="site-menu-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="site-menu-toggle" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="site-menu-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Menu</span></button><div class="site-menu-panel" id="site-menu-panel"><nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Product</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/how-pairvu-works">How Pairvu works</a><a aria-current="page" href="/checks">Product checks</a><a href="/account/batches/new">Batch checking</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></div></div><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Learn</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/ai-product-photography">AI product photography</a><a href="/examples">Comparison examples</a><a href="/guides">Guides</a></div></div><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Solutions</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/categories">Product categories</a><a href="/use-cases">Use cases</a></div></div></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="header-account-link" aria-busy="true" href="/account">Account</a><a class="header-cta" href="/#checker">Check image</a></div></div></div></header><div id="main-content"><main class="content-page"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","@id":"https://pairvu.com/checks#collection","name":"What to Check in AI Product Images","headline":"What to Check in AI Product Images","description":"Use evidence-backed checks for product quantity, label text, packaging, logos, color, components, and visibility before publishing an AI-assisted product image.","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://pairvu.com/#website"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://pairvu.com/#organization"},"mainEntity":{"@type":"ItemList","numberOfItems":7,"itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"How to Check Product Quantity in AI Images","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-quantity"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How to Check Product Label Text in AI Images","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-label-text"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"How to Check Product Packaging in AI Images","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-packaging"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Check Whether AI Changed a Product Logo","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-logo"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":5,"name":"Check Whether AI Changed Product Color","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-color"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":6,"name":"How to Check Product Components in AI Images","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-components"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":7,"name":"Can This Product Image Be Reliably Checked?","url":"https://pairvu.com/checks/product-image-observability"}]}}</script><div class="content-container"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://pairvu.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Product Checks","item":"https://pairvu.com/checks"}]}</script><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><span>Product Checks</span></li></ol></nav><header class="content-hero content-hero-compact"><p class="eyebrow">Attribute-level product QA</p><h1>What to Check in AI Product Images</h1><p class="content-deck">Each check answers one approval question across product categories. Use these pages when you need more than a single example: a precise attribute model, evidence requirements, decision rules, and next action.</p><div class="content-actions"><a class="primary-link-button" href="/#checker">Check your image pair</a><a class="text-link" href="/examples">Browse controlled examples</a></div></header><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="checks-difference"><p class="section-label">Choose the right content</p><h2 id="checks-difference">A check page is a decision method, not another example</h2><div class="comparison-table check-family-model"><div><span>Example</span><h3>One controlled pair</h3><p>Shows what changed, what stayed stable, and the observed or expected result.</p></div><div><span>Category</span><h3>One product domain</h3><p>Explains which attributes define cosmetics, beverages, personal care, or packaged food.</p></div><div><span>Check</span><h3>One attribute across products</h3><p>Defines the evidence and verdict rules for quantity, label text, packaging, color, or another visible attribute.</p></div></div></section><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="published-checks"><p class="section-label">Quality-gated library</p><h2 id="published-checks">Visible product checks</h2><p>A detailed page becomes public only after it has four controlled cases, complete PASS / REVIEW / FAIL guidance, diagnostic questions, limitations, founder approval, and an automated content-quality pass.</p><div class="check-topic-list"><a href="/checks/product-quantity"><div><h3>Product quantity</h3><p>Separate printed amount, primary package count, included units, and commercial pack configuration.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-label-text"><div><h3>Product label text</h3><p>Distinguish confirmed wording changes from unreadable, hidden, or non-corresponding text regions.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-packaging"><div><h3>Product packaging</h3><p>Evaluate container form, closures, major components, package coverage, and harmless lighting changes.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-logo"><div><h3>Logo and brand mark</h3><p>Compare logo identity while separating a confirmed replacement from partial occlusion or insufficient resolution.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-color"><div><h3>Product color</h3><p>Separate deliberate package recoloring from scene light, reflection, shadow, transparency, and white balance.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-components"><div><h3>Product components</h3><p>Distinguish missing, substituted, added, hidden, and harmlessly repositioned product parts or included accessories.</p></div><span>Published</span></a><a href="/checks/product-image-observability"><div><h3>Observability</h3><p>Identify exactly which correspondence, crop, viewpoint, occlusion, reflection, or resolution problem prevents a reliable answer.</p></div><span>Published</span></a></div></section><section class="article-section wide-article-section" aria-labelledby="quantity-preview"><p class="section-label">Featured flagship check</p><h2 id="quantity-preview">Product quantity is more than the number printed on a label</h2><p>The first detailed check separates a printed amount from primary package count and pack configuration. These controlled comparisons show why a 330 mL to 500 mL edit, one box becoming two, and a harmless perspective change require different decisions.</p><div class="case-card-grid"><a class="case-card" href="/examples/label-value-change-ai-product-image"><div class="case-card-images"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><img alt="NOVA FIZZ capacity changed from 330 mL to 500 mL" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Flabel-value-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div><span>Printed amount</span><h3>330 mL became 500 mL</h3><p>One package remains visible, but its customer-facing capacity changes.</p></div></a><a class="case-card" href="/examples/product-count-change-ai-image"><div class="case-card-images"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><img alt="One GRAINLY box became two boxes" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Fcandidate.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div><span>Primary package count</span><h3>One box became two</h3><p>Each package still says 300 g, but the represented offer is no longer one box.</p></div></a><a class="case-card" href="/examples/product-repositioning-perspective-change"><div class="case-card-images"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Fproduct-count-change%2Foriginal.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><img alt="The same GRAINLY box at a slight angle" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="220px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fexamples%2Freposition-perspective%2Fperspective.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div><span>Hard negative</span><h3>Position changed, quantity did not</h3><p>One readable package remains one readable package after ordinary recomposition.</p></div></a></div><div class="content-actions"><a class="primary-link-button" href="/checks/product-quantity">Open the Product Quantity check</a></div></section><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="verdict-ladder"><p class="section-label">Shared decision language</p><h2 id="verdict-ladder">The result depends on evidence, not visual surprise</h2><div class="case-fact-grid"><div><span>PASS</span><strong>Required attributes are observable and match</strong></div><div><span>REVIEW</span><strong>A required fact is uncertain, hidden, or needs intent confirmation</strong></div><div><span>FAIL</span><strong>An approval-critical visible attribute is confirmed changed</strong></div></div><p>Provider errors and system failures remain execution failures rather than product verdicts. A check page never replaces the approved reference, invents hidden facts, or turns an unreadable region into a mismatch.</p></section><section class="article-section article-cta"><h2>Start with the attribute that could change the customer&#x27;s understanding</h2><p>Use the approved image as the source of truth and inspect the final candidate before publishing.</p><div class="content-actions"><a class="primary-link-button" href="/#checker">Check image</a><a class="text-link" href="/guides/ai-product-photography-checklist">Use the pre-publish checklist</a><a class="text-link" href="/categories">Browse category workflows</a></div></section></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-footer-inner"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="site-logo" href="/"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="site-logo-art" viewBox="0 0 236 72" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="pairvu-brand-gradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#2f80ff"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7a4dff"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="url(#pairvu-brand-gradient)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="19" width="28" height="29" rx="6" stroke-width="5"></rect><path d="m9 42 8-8 7 7 4-4 5 5" stroke-width="4"></path><rect x="39" y="19" width="28" height="29" rx="6" stroke-width="5"></rect><path d="m43 42 8-8 7 7 4-4 5 5" stroke-width="4"></path><circle cx="36" cy="34" r="11" fill="#0b133f" stroke-width="5"></circle><circle cx="36" cy="34" r="3" fill="url(#pairvu-brand-gradient)" stroke="none"></circle><circle cx="36" cy="58" r="8" fill="url(#pairvu-brand-gradient)" stroke="none"></circle><path d="m32.5 58 2.4 2.4 5-5.2" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.8"></path></g><path d="m29 12 2.2 4.8L36 19l-4.8 2.2L29 26l-2.2-4.8L22 19l4.8-2.2z" fill="#2f80ff"></path><path d="m42 8 1.5 3.2L47 13l-3.5 1.5L42 18l-1.5